  "evidence": "The two uses of substitution in the inert elliptic logarithm comparison were traced through their selected suppliers to the coefficient recurrence, Frobenius congruence and its gain under pth powers. Independent checks use a Teichmüller lift in the unramified cubic extension at 5 and the binomial coefficient (625 choose 5).",
